# The record that launches a Structure by name has one argument, data (R21, item 4; R22, item 3; plan M11 5b): two
# positional arguments give no form -- answer 5.
# Plan M11 5v: the declarations of ordinary Structures live in the data part of main; the root holds places and the
# call main().
sub: main () (
    Bump(n := n + 1)
    A(int: n 0)
    B(int: n 0)
    int: seen 0
)
    fn: f () int
        Bump(A B)
        return: A\n
    seen := f()
main()
int: seen main\data\seen
